      "message": "kotlin_record_members(members) has been changed recently [https://dawn.googlesource.com/dawn/+/refs/heads/main/generator/dawn_json_generator.py#827], where we modifying the member in case of \"callback info\" to \"callback\". So, this- {% if member.type.category \u003d\u003d \"callback info\" %} - won\u0027t be met for any members.",
