      "message": "The goal is to find the \u0027callback info\u0027 member that corresponds to the \u0027callback\u0027 member, and then check if that \u0027callback info\u0027 member has a \u0027mode\u0027 member.\n\nWe can use find_by_name to determine if a member has \u0027mode\u0027 or \u0027callback\u0027, but I don\u0027t think we have any utility function to find the corresponding \u0027callback info\u0027 from a \u0027callback\u0027 member.",
