      "writtenOn": "2025-10-17T20:25:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It should still work (I think). You already iterate through all the members, so anytime you see a `callback function` type, you would search for the corresponding `callback info` type by searching for `name + \" info\"` or something like that.\n\nThen you could do it inline without having to do the pass above to figure out which members have a mode type ahead of time.",
